# BookFlow

This repository is for the XPRTZ code assignment **XPRTZ Code Opdracht 2025**. The assignment describes BookFlow, a platform intended to connect authors, publishers, and distributors and modernize the process from manuscript submission through publication and distribution.

The brief focuses on managing book and manuscript information, coordinating publishing workflows, integrating with external services reliably, sending real-time updates, and building a scalable system with automated tests.

