            Topic --> ProgressSub
            Topic --> PrintingSub
            Topic --> InventorySub
        end
    end

    Users -->|"HTTPS"| Ingress
    Distributors -->|"Authenticated callbacks"| Ingress
    PrintProvider -->|"Production and delivery callbacks"| Ingress
    Ingress --> Frontend
    Frontend -->|"Authorized application requests"| WebApp
    Frontend -->|"Private notification ingress"| Notifications

    WebApp -->|"Committed domain events via SQL outbox"| EventGrid
    Frontend -->|"Validated callback events via SQL outbox"| EventGrid
    Assignment -->|"EditorAssigned via SQL outbox"| EventGrid
    Proofprint -->|"ProofprintCreated via SQL outbox"| EventGrid
