    AssignmentSub --> Assignment
    ProofprintSub --> Proofprint
    ProgressSub --> Progress
    PrintingSub --> Printing
    InventorySub --> Inventory

    Apps -->|"Shared SQL persistence"| PrivateEndpoints
    WebApp -->|"Immutable manuscript files"| PrivateEndpoints
    Proofprint -->|"Source files and generated PDFs"| PrivateEndpoints
    PrivateEndpoints --- SQL
    PrivateEndpoints --- Blob
    PrivateEndpoints --- Topic
